# AETHONE deviation from the Flutter template (v4.9): the Gradle wrapper
# (jar + gradlew scripts) IS committed so any clone builds reproducibly
# with the pinned 9.8.2 distribution — no template/network re-generation
# step can drift. Version is pinned in gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties.
!gradle-wrapper.jar
!gradlew
!gradlew.bat
/.gradle
/captures/
/local.properties
GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
